  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Validation and route to market assignment HortiNord</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project builds upon project CSS23CI03 and will furthermore develop the blueprint for the HortiNord training and demonstration centre in Toumbokro, that will first be focused on &apos;conventional&apos; horticulture.It will result in solidifying the partnership, including local partner(s) for the envisaged centre and provide a guideline for the route to market activities to be developed alongside.</narrative>
  </description>
